  "description": "Embedded real-time log dashboard for SinkSharp. Mounts on your existing ASP.NET Core app at the same host and port — no extra process, no extra port. Free alternative to Seq ($500/yr). Copy correlation ID to clipboard, shareable URL with active filters, per-sink minimum level support.",
