  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 - Fix\n• dashboard issue fix and version update in footer\nv1.0.1 — New features\n• Copy correlation ID to clipboard — ⧉ button in detail panel; 1.5s confirmation\n• Shareable URL with active filters — level/service/corr/search/time encoded in URL hash; restores on page load\n• WithDashboard(out sink, minLevel) — per-sink minimum level for the dashboard\n• Regex search toggle — .* button switches between plain text and RegExp search\n• Buffer capacity in stats bar — shows actual configured capacity from server stats\n• CSV export alongside JSON — Export dropdown offers JSON and CSV formats\n• Reconnect indicator — topbar shows Reconnecting (attempt N)... and flashes Reconnected\nv1.0.0 — Stable release\n• Real-time SignalR WebSocket streaming\n• 500-event circular buffer replayed on connect\n• Level filter, service filter, full-text search, time filter\n• Properties tab, Stack trace tab, Details tab\n• Export JSON, dark/light theme, auto-scroll, pause/resume\n• Bearer JWT, shared token, IP allowlist, Basic auth, role check, custom policy\n• Redis multi-pod backplane support\n• JWT expiry detection — token bar reappears 60s before expiry\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/CHANGELOG.md",
